  "summary": "I’m a seasoned software developer fluent in C#, .NET Core, Blazor, Python, React, and several other acronyms most people politely nod at. With over 20 years of hands-on experience, I’ve built everything from enterprise APIs to elegant front ends, and debugged just as many things I swear “shouldn’t have broken.”\n\nI specialize in crafting clean, scalable code and turning legacy chaos into maintainable architecture. I enjoy modern frameworks, but I’m no stranger to jumping into the trenches of old codebases either. Whether it’s building apps in ASP.NET, optimizing SQL queries by hand (because ORMs aren’t magic), or designing full-stack solutions that perform under pressure, I’m in.\n\nI believe great code should make your life easier, not more complicated and that software teams work best when you mix technical skill with a good sense of humor and zero ego.\n\nLet’s build something useful. Or at least something that doesn’t crash before lunch.",
